+        """Give placed instances of a symbol the library fields they lack.
+
+        Repairs instances written before placement copied every library field:
+        each missing field is added with the library's value and visibility, and
+        a Value that is just the symbol's name becomes the library's Value. A
+        visible field is placed where the library puts it relative to the
+        Value, so ratings stay stacked under the instance's (possibly moved)
+        Value. Fields the instance already has are left as they are. Returns
+        the number of instances changed; the caller's file is rewritten only
+        when that is not zero.
